{
  "thought_summary": "首先需要定位 flatten.py 文件中的 flatten 函数，以检查其处理非列表叶节点时的返回值。",
  "action": {
    "type": "tool",
    "tool_name": "list_files",
    "arguments": {
      "path": ".",
      "max_depth": 1,
      "max_entries": 10
    }
  }
}

{
  "thought_summary": "已找到 flatten.py 文件，下一步是检查该文件中 flatten 函数的实现，以确定其处理非列表叶节点时的返回值。",
  "action": {
    "type": "tool",
    "tool_name": "inspect_code",
    "arguments": {
      "file_path": "flatten.py",
      "start_line": 1,
      "context_lines": 10,
      "max_lines": 50
    }
  }
}

{
  "thought_summary": "flatten 函数在处理非列表叶节点时返回了生成器对象，而不是叶节点本身。需要进一步验证该行为是否符合问题描述。",
  "action": {
    "type": "tool",
    "tool_name": "search_code",
    "arguments": {
      "query": "yield",
      "path": "flatten.py",
      "regex": false,
      "case_sensitive": false,
      "max_results": 5
    }
  }
}

